      "text": "Transition point in dilated SB; whirl/whirlpool sign"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " → closed-loop SBO / volvulus → ischemia risk"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
